The companion catalogue uses French species names and primary types from the PokéAPI data files (https://github.com/PokeAPI/pokeapi/tree/master/data/v2/csv).
The Pokédex entries and legendary/mythical categories use pokemon_species_flavor_text.csv and pokemon_species.csv at revision 193d8d4fbb57cf962e3f7c1ce5299a6fe847b3f8 of https://github.com/PokeAPI/pokeapi. The PokéAPI repository's copyright notice, redistribution conditions and disclaimer are reproduced in LICENSES/PokeAPI-BSD-3-Clause.txt. Pokédex text belongs to the respective Pokémon rights holders.
At runtime, companion sprites are downloaded from https://github.com/PokeAPI/sprites at revision c0542f7c51215d9672439012838c99f520596cbd, including Pokémon Showdown battle sprites and the Black & White animated collection. That repository states that all image contents are copyright The Pokémon Company; its CC0 notice does not grant rights held by third parties.

Agent sidebar portraits are downloaded on demand from https://github.com/PMDCollab/SpriteCollab/tree/db320e8dc12f5dfc6fb9355abd56e6cbc83933e1/portrait. SpriteCollab contributors offer their original portrait contributions under CC BY-NC 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/). Individual contributors are listed at https://github.com/PMDCollab/SpriteCollab/blob/db320e8dc12f5dfc6fb9355abd56e6cbc83933e1/portrait/NNNN/credits.txt, where NNNN is the zero-padded National Pokédex number. The license does not grant rights to the underlying Pokémon characters or official game artwork. The portrait is shown at a reduced size, without other modifications.

The ten league badge PNGs in mods/oaklabs-companions/badges/ come from the Pokémon badge artwork by Stephen Griffiths (2011), https://github.com/SteGriff/pokemon-badges, licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). Individual PNG files were obtained from https://pokesprite.tootaio.com/sprites/badges/. Badges 1–8 correspond to Kanto, badge 9 to source number 17, and badge 10 to source number 40. Pokémon badge designs belong to their respective rights holders.
